    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nKimi-VL can deadlock on the first image request when DP attention is enabled with more than one DP group and `attn_tp_size > 1`, such as TP4/DP2.\r\n\r\nMoonViT shards its attention output projection and MLP output projection across the attention TP group, but these layers reduce through the global TP group. Only the DP group handling the image executes these collectives, so ranks enqueue different collective sequences.\r\n\r\nFixes #34442.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Use the DP-attention TP group for the MoonViT attention output projection.\r\n- Use the DP-attention TP group for the MoonViT MLP output projection.\r\n- Add a unit test covering both reduction paths.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nThe change only selects the communicator for existing reductions.\r\nThe added unit test checks both projections.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nNot run. The change does not add collectives or alter tensor shapes; it routes two existing reductions to the attention TP group.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\r\n\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39019847438](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39019847438)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39019847426](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39019847426)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39019847453](https://gi